; Missing units inside total braces are a missing number like any other:
; beside an auto-posting there are too many, and on their own they cannot
; be solved for at the zero per-unit cost total braces imply, which
; beancount reports on the posting, booking the rest of the group and
; reporting its residual. Each such posting has an account of its own:
; bean-check keeps it incomplete and fails on a later posting to the
; account.
